  "sourceTitle": "Monkey Milkshake",
  "sourceText": "Monkey Milkshake\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup strawberries, fresh or frozen\n1 banana\n1 cup milk\n2 teaspoons vanilla\n3 ice cubes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine ingredients in blender and whirl until smooth and fluffy. Serve cold.\n\nAbout\n\n\nWatch out for the Monkey Mustache!",
